{
  "schema": 1,
  "description": "Habits (docs/habits.md, supabase/migrations/0010_habits.sql). A habit has a cadence (daily; weekdays, with 'weekdays' a bitmask Monday 1, Tuesday 2, Wednesday 4 ... Sunday 64; per_week or per_month, with 'times' N), a measure (check: a day is met by a check-in of value 1 or more; count and amount: by a day's value reaching 'target') and 'startsOn'. 'due': whether the habit is due on 'day' (weekly and monthly habits are due any day). 'periods': the first and last day of the habit's period holding 'day' (the day; the week from its Monday; the month). 'states': the state of the period starting on 'period', the first that applies of: none (it ends before startsOn, or a day that isn't due), met (days met in it, not skipped, reach 1, or N for a week or month), paused (a pause overlaps it; 'until' null is open-ended), skipped (a check-in in it is skipped), open (it ends on or after 'today'), missed. 'streaks': met periods counted back from the one holding 'today'; open, paused, skipped and none periods are passed over, the first missed one ends it, and it stops before startsOn. 'heat': a day's heatmap value: null before startsOn or when not due, 'paused' in a pause, 'skipped' for a skipped check-in, else the day's value against its target from 0 to 1 (a check is 0 or 1). 'rings': today's ring: the day's value against the target for daily and weekday habits (null when today isn't due), days met so far against N for weekly and monthly ones, at most 1. 'checkinIds': the name-based UUID of 'checkin/<habit id, lowercase>/<day>' in namespace b8c61b22-5e0c-4f0a-9d1e-6f4a2c7e3b91 (a day's one check-in). 'goalAmounts': the check-in values that count toward a numeric goal: habits serving the goal, measured by count or amount, whose unit is the goal's once both are lowercased without spaces, check-ins not skipped, on a day in the goal's period, in input order. 2026-09-18 is a Friday.",
